  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dy1FKre.png\" alt=\"banner\" width=\"2000\" height=\"500\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pxH1n9F.png\" alt=\"divider\" width=\"1280\" height=\"32\"><br><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/PGbeb4GgYm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hHW2NuB.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"66\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/jimbomods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8Obm0XS.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"66\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpareidoliamods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nA6YPt6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"66\"></a><br></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>資訊：</strong>&nbsp;Bibliophilia 是一款相當基礎的材質包，會將所有附魔書改為獨特的紋理。它非常適合偏好更貼近原版、設計更簡約的附魔書外觀的玩家。Bibliophilia 在悅目的設計、易於辨識以及整潔的物品欄之間取得了完美的平衡。<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">請注意，目前此材質包與 MOD Dynamic Trims 存在不相容問題。如果已安裝 Dynamic Trims，本材質包將無法正常運作。</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>本資源包需要 CIT 相關 MOD 才能運作<br>&nbsp;</strong>適用於 1.18-1.21.1：請使用 <a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cit-resewn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>CIT Resewn</strong></a> 或&nbsp;<strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-cit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge CIT</a><br></strong>&nbsp;1.21.2-1.21.4 目前尚不支援<strong><br></strong>&nbsp;1.21.5 即將推出！</span><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pxH1n9F.png\" alt=\"divider\" width=\"1280\" height=\"32\"><br><strong>目前功能</strong>：本包目前已重新設計至 1.21 為止的所有原版附魔書紋理，同時還收錄了大量來自其他 MOD 的書籍。自 1.16 起支援以下 MOD：<br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ad-astra-giselle-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ad Astra: Giselle Addon</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Additional Additions</a><br>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aileron\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aileron</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Caves<br></a>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves-torpedoes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Caves: Stuff &amp; Torpedoes</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Mobs</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs-interaction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Mobs Interaction</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/allurement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Allurement</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amethyst-imbuement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Amethyst Imbuement</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apotheosis</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apothic-enchanting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apothic Enchanting</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archery-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Archery Expansion</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elemental\"