ow.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchwork-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MD2eMsz.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></span></p>",
